{"server":"cn","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_07_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_07","title":"五省盘","storyCode":"OR-7","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d06083a98b676f73e9ea0550968bfed294773bd68f5bf4e558879950b7df5060","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g14_yanprison"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是命大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在大理寺干了这么多年，进了死狱还有机会活着出来的，你是头一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这样的结果，在下自己也没想到就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你们这些吃墨水的，就是有这个臭毛病。做事只为了一口气，不考虑后果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查了这么久的案子，这么多年的心血，就换来百珍宴上送上的一道菜，换来一个龙颜大怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闹这么一出，落得这个下场，你就满意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞兄教训得是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在下所作所为，于忠于义，都问心无愧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窥见渊鳞者为大不祥，还真是不祥......接下来你如何打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"调令已经下来，三天后随外交使团，前往维多利亚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此事过后，我再无可能留在百灶。这样的安排，也是尚书大人争取来的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维多利亚？你这副身子，如何撑得过那段路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒙恩逢赦，夫复何求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况此次去维多利亚，我也算回家了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还能算是家吗？我记得你说，你的妻女都已经亡故了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......很多年前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你觉得就算我信了你这句话，其他人会信？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能记得当年的事，自然也会有别人记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次回去，你知道会有多少双眼睛盯着你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顾筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该怎么做......还请虞兄明示。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借先生人命一用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要的清白真相，我给你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"narration","text":"我第一次来到百灶求学时，印象最深的，是遮天蔽日的高楼和望不到头的万家灯火。\n而那灯火的中央，就是禁城。\n危楼千尺，高耸入云，目不能视。\n老师说，这里进行的每一项决策、下达的每一条政令，都会影响万千百姓的生计。责任之重，重于山岳。\n也因此，这里应当是每个学子，一生才学得以施展的地方。\n为天地立心，为生民立命。\n然而，当我真的站在这里，面对这琼楼玉宇、深宫高墙——\n我感到令人透不过气的寒意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人来得真早。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？梁大人看上去好像很惊讶，是不乐意见到我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是没有听说，宁小姐也要来参加百珍宴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尚书大人身体抱恙，今年礼部只好由我代他出席了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是临时的决定，没有来得及告诉梁大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过梁大人赴宴的事，好像也没有打算告诉我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只当是公事......便没有烦扰宁小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"突然想起，尚蜀一别，和梁大人也已有大半年未见。这期间，我们书信都没有通过几次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"书信难通，又耽于公务，确实疏于联络了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐怪罪，我无可辩驳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪里会责怪梁大人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人担任知府时，心中就放不下家乡的一草一木。如今职责有变，要操心的事只会更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是不知怎么，只是过了半年，就觉得和梁大人之间好像又变得生分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些话，也说不出口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，梁大人应该是第一次参加这百珍宴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......早年在尚蜀为官，与这等政务自是少有交集。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"历年百珍宴上，往往都是有一些大事要商定的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知今年，这场兵戈之事，陛下会如何决断呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁某不敢对上意妄加揣测。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但梁大人是聪明人，总是能猜对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那日，梁大人其实是有事，想要找祖父他商议的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在下不敢欺瞒宁小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，你愿意来见我，我总是开心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但恐怕对于梁大人来说，我始终不是可以信赖和托付的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁小姐，应该是误会了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有责怪梁大人的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初披上这身红袍，谁不厌恶这些官场阴私？可又不得不做些曲意周旋之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宁某虽未身处朝局的中央，但也明白了一个道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真话难，让别人相信你说的是真话，更难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入了这道宫墙，“真心”两字，是最站不住脚的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可梁某人，对宁小姐，总是真心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论将来发生何事，在下总希望，宁小姐记得——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁辞秋","speakerId":"avg_npc_298_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，该入席了。我们进去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g10_restaurantkitchen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快点快点！最后再确认一遍食材！客人都已经入席了，等命令一下，就要上菜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再清点一遍所有食材，检查一下炖菜和汤的状态！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紧张的年轻厨师","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"九十号灶上的“福寿全”，不知道怎么的，汤的颜色看上去就是差一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么搞的？说了多少遍，切成一寸见方的块，一点都不能多；十个时辰的火候，一点也不能断！肯定又是哪个步骤马虎了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"资深厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......！放着放着，我过去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）哎哎......这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么还穿着这身衣服！是生怕别人注意不到你，还是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出席正式场合，当然要着正装......这一套还是我留在家里备用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这里是后厨！你就没有更合适点的衣服？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们大理寺的调查员，易容打扮什么的不该是基本功吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是什么歪理，大理寺少卿又不是什么见不得光的身份——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是最近这阵子，不知道为什么总在做些偷偷摸摸的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了，这套衣服给你。一会你就跟着上菜的队伍混进宴会现场，到时候你再换上你这身袍子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......混进这样的场合，还真是有点紧张......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说一会你站出来伸冤，万一惹得真龙大怒，他会不会直接把你抓起来，甚至......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百珍宴向来有进谏献言的传统，何况我们只是要求重审一件证据不齐的旧案，真龙又何必迁怒于我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是有一件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有想过，万一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一，我们将这件案子查到最后，得到的真相和我们想的截然不同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万一......你发现，你周围的一切，都是一个巨大的谎言......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这又是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们做了这么多事，不就是为了查到一个真相？是谎言就戳破它，还有什么可犹豫的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都已经走到这一步了，我们还有什么选择？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煌......我觉得，你的父亲他，应该是个好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？干嘛突然说这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"答应我，一会要是发生了什么意外，一定先保护好自——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘，别说了！来人了，先躲起来！灶台下面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都准备好了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准......准备好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你负责的这碗长寿面，虽然简单，却也是至关重要的一道菜，不能有一点差错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明......明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我不知道，你的师父为什么不愿意来百珍宴，但我相信他挑中你，总归有他的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次宴席办完后，我给你一个机会，来接我的衣钵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不乐意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......能当您的徒弟，应该有不少厨师做梦都会笑醒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我不明白，为什么您一定要将毕生手艺只传于一人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐......你可知这鼎丰楼每一任总厨，挑选徒弟要经过多少道考核？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"远的不说，我师父编《食经》，整理四大菜系菜谱，经手了几十年的百珍宴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这鼎丰楼厨房，数百号同样跟着他在厨道上磨砺了多年的厨师里，师父也只挑了我一人来接班。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖祖辈辈传下来的精贵手艺，岂是能随随便便传人的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，不管多么精贵的手艺，做出来的菜，总是要给人吃的呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......我的意思是说，教出一个厨艺可以和您比肩的徒弟，真的比教出一群厨艺不错的厨师更重要吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您教的人越多，会做菜的人也就越多，更多的大炎人才能吃到更美味的菜不是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......歪理邪说，不知敬畏！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫不服","speakerId":"avg_npc_1619_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先好好准备你的面吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都准备就绪了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门已经进入最高战备状态，城防武器皆已就位。城中百姓全部遣散，仅余两万战士、三千天师，随时可以奔赴战场。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只待军令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那且看今晚这月色，到底阴晴如何吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，太尉的信使到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个时候？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那人没有带信，他只是送来了......一盒月饼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信使说，太尉有一句话要带给将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“趁热吃，不可等凉了。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_pawnshop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"左公子的确看懂了在下的提示。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又见面了......左公子，别来无恙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必紧张，这家当铺关门许久了，不会有人来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你单独约见我，是想做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不应该反过来问左公子吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年逗留百灶的时候，随兴开了这家当铺，生意也一度红火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天都有客人送来各式各样的古玩字画、金玉奇石......结果被我那个喜欢摆弄山河的弟弟顺走不少——都摆到他的园林里去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最有趣的一点是，光顾这家当铺的客人都有一个共同点——他们都是有求于我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你未免自视过高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过左公子既然还愿意来见在下，那不正是说明左公子也想谈谈？左公子心中疑问，在下或许能够解答一二呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在意......你们来到百灶，目的究竟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那个罪人决意在此时与炎国开战，那等待他的结果只会是自取灭亡——他不会不清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊......我那个哥哥，别无所长，唯独对这纵横之术，颇有心得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子可还记得，在玉门出现的那一伙山海众？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"司岁台事后调查复盘，发现其中有另一只巨兽所化的代理人行动的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事中，望同样有嫌疑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子当然应该记得，千年前的那场围猎，大炎领土内的数只巨兽，要么被消灭，要么被驱逐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那司岁台是否想过，他既然能找到其中一只......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他找到的，就仅有那一只吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年以来，司岁台始终警惕着他在炎国的一举一动，是不是忘了去想，他的棋子落在炎国之外的可能性？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要小看司岁台的情报......司岁台从未中断过对那几只巨兽的跟踪观察。那些巨兽如果有所异动，巨兽学士一定会有所察觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算算时间，他们应该已经在赶回来的路上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这份情报，可以当作我送给左公子的一份薄礼。至于要如何使用，左公子可以自行决断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要告诉我这件事？你既然已经与那个罪人同谋，为何要告诉司岁台他的打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实不相瞒......我与那个哥哥虽然是合作，可各自的心思，多少还是有些分别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他执意要分出个胜负，我倒是觉得，和和气气地把生意做下去更重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于为什么要挑选左公子......就当是我觉得，与左公子投缘吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_4121_zuole_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自诩有几分识人的本事，直觉告诉我，将来还会有与左公子打交道的机会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不定以后，我们兄弟姐妹的生死去向，都要仰仗左公子的决断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"绩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1236_1","isRemote":false,"text":"值此佳节，能和左公子少叙片刻，也算是缘分......希望左公子将来，也能将在下当作可以交谈的“人”吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心大意的厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么搞的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心大意的厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起！我、我刚才手抽筋了！没拿稳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真是......唉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"粗心大意的厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1636_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起！我这就去厨房，重新端一盘备餐出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"领头的厨师","speakerId":"avg_npc_1635_1","isRemote":false,"text":"动作快点！百官都已经入席了，等真龙到场，宴会就要开始了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人？您需要帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......我是来参加百珍宴的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与会的各位官员都已入席落座，您怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉......来的路上耽误了一些时间，我这就进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这位大人，请出示一下您的百珍宴请柬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为何？我已经站在这里，还需要向你出示请柬吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"例行检查，还请大人见谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人......大人！您东西落下了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"着急的女子","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您刚刚出门走得急，怎么把最要紧的东西落在家里了呀。还好让我看到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来是户部的唐大人，多有得罪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡逻的卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么问题了，宴会马上就要开始了，还请唐大人尽快入席吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请柬是我伪造的，只能骗过这一时，还请麟少卿小心行事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认得你......你是宁府的小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是煌的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在百珍宴厨师名单上看到了煌的名字，就猜到了你们的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的事，只能在见到真龙之后再请他宽宥了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你可知......要是这件旧案重见天日，必定殃及你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这个旧案牵连最深的人，应该是煌才对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿不是已经答应帮煌查明真相了吗，还有什么别的好顾忌的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宁茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况......麟少卿若真的能让这件事水落石出，那样的结果，我求之不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"narration","text":"为官数载，我也极少踏入这座禁城。\n我看到一幢幢高抵穹宇的宫殿庄严伟岸，屹立挺拔。\n我看到宴席繁盛无两，高朋满座。灯火如昼，月色入怀。\n可我看不透......\n是谁有意掩盖那些名字，是谁不愿让真相大白？\n我忽然想起了前辈曾经说过的那句话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“你能否担得起真相的分量？”"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄......你到底，看到了什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪，已经是开宴的时间了，陛下怎么还没有到呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1633_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫要着急，陛下事务繁忙，或许是被什么要紧事牵绊住了一时半刻，我们静候就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌乱的官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1632_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前听说陛下身体有恙已经有一阵子了，难道真有此事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉稳的官员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1633_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘......别乱说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"岂有此理！简直岂有此理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里是什么地方？你们有什么道理阻拦朝廷命官？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何事喧闹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卫兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1637_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人说他是户部侍郎唐俭，可是我们核对过，户部的座席分明已经坐满了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愤怒的户部官员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"荒唐！什么叫“我说我是”？你好好看看我是谁？你看我手中的官印是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_moon"},{"type":"narration","text":"喧嚣戛然而止。\n第三声号角，夜晚戌时。\n明月当空，照得夜色清朗，容不下一丝杂色。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g6_baizhenbanquet"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"宣礼官","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"正礼——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"百官纷纷起立，屏息凝神，目视宴席最中央的位置。\n待到那道身影出现在主位——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"臣有事要奏！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i12"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"火。\n不知从何处腾起的一簇火苗，只借着一阵秋夜的风，席卷了整个宴席。\n蹿腾的火舌形似奇诡异兽，张牙舞爪，盘桓在宴席上空。\n又一阵风吹来，火焰异兽的身躯高高升起，迅速爆燃膨胀，并发出了令人不安的声音，仿佛它在大声地嘶吼着，嗤笑着——\n自它倾泻而出的幽异火光早已浸染了百珍宴，此刻正闪动着，攀上官员们慌张的脸庞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这是......怎么回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
